	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0401_boy1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あのね　きんようびに　なると
とんでくる　ポケモンが　いるんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T08:45:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T08:05:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あのね　金曜日に　なると
飛んでくる　ポケモンが　いるんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T07:29:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T08:06:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：Black2ver
・バルチャイのヒント</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:17:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T08:45:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0401_man3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おおきい　ポケモンを　つれていたら
ボクだって　スリムに　みえるさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:06:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:05:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大きい　ポケモンを　連れていたら
ボクだって　スリムに　みえるさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T07:29:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:07:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
